# Week 4 – Implementation Strategy and Code Architecture

This folder contains the Week 4 implementation strategy for AgriGuard AI –
Smart Crop Disease and Risk Prediction System.

The report covers:
- Implementation strategy
- System architecture
- Workflow diagrams
- Python module structure
- Core pseudocode
- Hypothesis formulation
- Evaluation metrics
- Maintainability and testing
- Generic implementation timeline
- Risk assessment and mitigation
- Dataset references and citations
